cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this hardware, please cite it as below."
title: "3DPLAM — 3D-Printed Lightweight Affordable Manifold for Microbial Water Quality Testing"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, 3D-printable membrane-filtration manifold for Escherichia coli
  quantification in drinking water, validated against the Millipore EZ-Fit
  stainless-steel manifold. Comprises a base, funnel and filter support, all
  printable without support structures on a consumer FDM printer.
type: software
license: CERN-OHL-S-2.0
